(Autonomous Flight Operations Safety Policy) '
(Document Code: POL-SAF-01 | Version: v2.0) '
(Organization: AeroPulse Avionics & Autonomous Systems Inc.) '
(-------------------------------------------------------) '
() '
(Section 1.3: Emergency Propeller Clear Zone Mandate) '
(Prior to connecting battery power or arming autonomous UAV motors, a) '
(5-meter physical safety perimeter must be established and visually) '
(verified. Personnel must wear ANSI Z87.1 eye protection and Kevlar) '
(cut-resistant gloves during all propeller attachment and calibration) '
(procedures.) '
() '
(Section 4.1: Mandatory Incident Reporting Window) '
(Any near-miss, motor desynchronization, lost GPS lock, or unexpected) '
(autonomous course deviation must be logged in the AeroPulse Aviation) '
(Safety Action Program \(ASAP\) portal within 4 hours of flight) '
(termination.) '
ET
endstream
